{"id":"u-9d7d5872-0a03-4b6a-833c-5506dd66a185","src":"community","title":"Muscle & Strength - Dumbbell Increase Bench Press","author":"Kim K.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/I54Dsx-muscle-and-strength-dumbbell-increase-bench-press","desc":"This 8-week dumbbell bench press program is designed to help increase strength, improve pressing performance, and build confidence with dumbbell training. Even without a barbell, you can still develop serious upper-body power and improve your chest, shoulders, and triceps while working toward a stronger dumbbell bench press. \n\nPhysique development isn’t the primary goal of this program, but we still want to train the entire body and continue making progress. Provides enough volume to maintain and build lower-body strength without taking away from your pressing performance.\n\nOf course, eating properly and focusing on recovery will be vital to your success in this program:\n\nNutrition:\n- 1 gram of protein per pound of bodyweight\n- 1-2 grams of carbohydrates per pound of bodyweight\n- .3-.4 grams of fat per pound of bodyweight\n - 1 gallon of water a day\n - Supplements (Optional): Creatine, whey protein, pre-workout\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep - 7-8 hours every night is a must.\n- Stretching and Cardio: When time permits, but shoot for at least 2  sessions a week.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-16T14:32:11.402Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Heavy Bench Day","Lower Body Day","Light Bench Day","Upper Body Day","Full Body Day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":75,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Chest Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Decline Push Up","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":